function nowOk(p){if(!openOnly&&!actTags.size)return true;for(const k of actTags)if(!(p.tags||[]).includes(k))return false;if(openOnly){const s=stat(p);if(!s||!s.open)return false}return true}
function showSt(p){const c=$('#cst');c.innerHTML='';if(!p||!p.n)return;const s=stat(p);if(s)c.append(el('span',{className:'st'+(s.open?' on':''),textContent:(s.open?'● ':'○ ')+s.txt}));(p.tags||[]).forEach(k=>{const d=tagDefs().find(x=>x.k==k);if(d)c.append(el('span',{className:'st',textContent:d.i+' '+d.n}))})}
function nowUI(){const c=$('#nowc');c.innerHTML='';if(ADM)return;[...actTags].forEach(k=>{if(!tagDefs().some(d=>d.k==k))actTags.delete(k)});
const used=tagDefs().filter(d=>P.some(p=>!p.hide&&(p.tags||[]).includes(d.k))),anyH=P.some(p=>!p.hide&&p.hours);if(!used.length&&!anyH)return;
c.append(el('div',{className:'nt',textContent:'O que fazer agora'}));const row=el('div',{className:'nrow'}),chip=(txt,on,fn)=>{const b=el('button',{className:'chip',textContent:txt,onclick:fn});b.setAttribute('aria-pressed',on);row.append(b)};
if(anyH)chip('🟢 Aberto agora',openOnly,()=>{openOnly=!openOnly;render()});
used.forEach(d=>chip(d.i+' '+d.n,actTags.has(d.k),()=>{actTags.has(d.k)?actTags.delete(d.k):actTags.add(d.k);render()}));c.append(row);
if(openOnly||actTags.size){const n=P.filter(p=>!p.hide&&filt.has(p.c)&&nowOk(p)).length;c.append(el('div',{className:'ncnt'},n+(n==1?' local encontrado':' locais encontrados'),el('button',{className:'sm',textContent:'Limpar',onclick:()=>{openOnly=false;actTags.clear();render()}})))}}
setInterval(()=>{if(!ADM&&(openOnly||curP&&curP.n)){render();showSt(curP)}},60000);
